  [ok ] Psi* <= 2 Psi at (n,k)=(449,7)
  [ok ] Psi* <= 2 Psi at (n,k)=(736,8)
    Psi* <= 2 Psi, so UNIFORM-COLLAR's own stated stability condition
    Psi < 1/2 implies Psi* < 1.  Psi* < 1 is the sharp form; both are
    tabulated in V6.

